{"id":"vod_bf_10605","vodId":"10605","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"高达创战者TRY","name_cn":"高达创战者TRY","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-11/8b2884e31b865fa626fb8250fdd70ce4.jpg"},"summary":"故事开端为第一季故事的七年之后。　　高达模型对战的规则被革新，亦令其对战更受欢迎。　　虽然伊织诚和岭司得到第7回敢达模型对战世界大赛的冠军，也令学校圣凤学园沾光不少。不过，其“高达模型对战部”就只剩下部长—国中部3年级学生·星野文奈一人。　　在新比赛规则底下，如果要参加比赛必须以3人1组的参与战斗。而圣凤学园高达模型对战部郤因为人数不足的情况下难以出场。　　在偶然的之间，出现了一名转校生，就是跟随师傅修行多年次元霸王流拳法的神木世界。之后，被称为天才高达模型创制家的高坂祐马也加入。　　终于，星野文奈、神木世界、高坂祐马三人组成了Team·Try·fighters，能够在高达模型对战大赛中登场，向世界大赛展开挑战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:59:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022jyfuIaQQindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022lVDYlj9Sindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022gk19K8R0index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022Hjvl4oJgindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022OGrmHgbiindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022AHTaae4bindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022Wc1Hs8iNindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022a75qFnsTindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022rCiNSOLJindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241022PyL6348Xindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/vide